{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nFoundation for the Procs page, reusing the page template from the Docker skeleton.\n\n## Spec\n- Add the `sysinfo` crate for process enumeration (cross-platform: macOS / Linux)\n- `page \"procs\"` in `assets/default.kdl`, `\"5\" \"page:procs\"`\n- Refresh on a tick (interval in KDL, default 2s) with the snapshot taken on a background thread so the UI never blocks\n- `src/procs/` with `PageState` / `PaneSet` wiring\n\nPart of #93.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:23Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":94,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Procs: page skeleton"}
